{
 "duration": 27.154,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "An hour into a cold drizzle, Dan started tripping on roots, mumbling his words and fumbling with his zipper.",
   "start": 0.4,
   "end": 6.941
  },
  {
   "text": "He kept saying he was fine.",
   "start": 7.241,
   "end": 8.59
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's the fix.",
   "start": 8.99,
   "end": 9.917
  },
  {
   "text": "Learn the umbles: stumbles, mumbles, fumbles and grumbles.",
   "start": 10.267,
   "end": 13.95
  },
  {
   "text": "They can be early signs of hypothermia.",
   "start": 14.2,
   "end": 16.378
  },
  {
   "text": "Stop, get out of the wind, swap wet layers for dry ones, add a hat, and turn back together.",
   "start": 16.678,
   "end": 22.157
  },
  {
   "text": "If he doesn't improve, call for help.",
   "start": 22.407,
   "end": 24.223
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this before your next cold hike.",
   "start": 24.923,
   "end": 26.954
  }
 ],
